  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supp UNCT &amp; UNRC Tanzania in mainstreaming Human</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Title: Support to UNCT and the RC Tanzania in Mainstreaming Human Rights and LNOB. The proposed grant will support the UN Country Team and the UN Resident Coordinator in Tanzania in Mainstreaming Human Rights and Leaving No One Behind (LNOB) commitments. It will essentially cover the employment costs of the Human Rights Adviser (HRA) deployed through the Office of the High Commissioner for Human Rights (OHCHR). Apart from assistance to the UNCT, the HRA will support the integration of human rights commitments into the long term perspectives of Tanzania&#x2019;s 2050 vision, and work to enhance the capacity and engagement of other human rights stakeholders and institutions within the government of Tanzania.</narrative>
  </description>
